{"id":"level-up-2026-09-25","name":"2026-09-25 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s351","en":"The story follows a lonely wretch through a freezing winter.","zh":"这个故事讲述了一个孤苦的人度过严冬的经历。","note":"wretch · 不幸的人 · a poor wretch","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s352","en":"Repairing the leaking roof is our top priority this month.","zh":"修补漏水的屋顶是我们本月的首要任务。","note":"priority · 优先， 重点； 优先考虑的事 · a top priority","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s353","en":"The fishermen anchored their boats in a sheltered inlet.","zh":"渔民把船停泊在一个避风的小海湾里。","note":"inlet · 入口； 进口， 水湾 · a sheltered inlet","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s354","en":"The design challenge encouraged creative thinking among the younger students.","zh":"设计挑战鼓励了低年级学生进行创造性思考。","note":"creative · 创造性的； 创作的 · creative thinking","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s355","en":"A free shuttle connects the airport with the train station.","zh":"免费接驳车连接机场和火车站。","note":"shuttle · 航天飞机 · a shuttle bus","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s356","en":"The committee will allocate extra funds to the children's library.","zh":"委员会将给儿童图书馆拨出额外资金。","note":"allocate · 分配； 分派 · allocate resources","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s357","en":"Keeping ticket prices affordable remains the organisers' primary concern.","zh":"让票价保持可负担仍是组织者的首要考虑。","note":"primary · 最初的， 初级的； 首要的， 基本的 · a primary concern","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s358","en":"The geology teacher passed a piece of pumice around the class.","zh":"地质老师让全班传看了一块浮石。","note":"pumice · 浮石，浮岩；用浮岩磨 · a pumice stone","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s359","en":"A quiet weekend gave her time for much-needed introspection.","zh":"一个安静的周末给了她亟需的自省时间。","note":"introspection · 内省， 反省 · a period of introspection","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s360","en":"We keep a daily log of temperature changes in the greenhouse.","zh":"我们每天记录温室内的温度变化。","note":"log · 原木；航海或飞行日志；记录 · keep a log","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s361","en":"The exhibition compares traditional furniture from several Nordic countries.","zh":"展览比较了几个北欧国家的传统家具。","note":"Nordic · 北欧人的； 北欧国家的 · Nordic countries","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s362","en":"The café operates as a social enterprise supporting local training.","zh":"这家咖啡馆作为社会企业运营，支持当地培训。","note":"enterprise · 企业， 公司； 事业 · a social enterprise","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s363","en":"Large windows provide ventilation in the busy school kitchen.","zh":"大窗户为繁忙的学校厨房提供通风。","note":"ventilation · 空气流通； 通风设备， 通风方法 · adequate ventilation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s364","en":"Solar panels on the roof supply electricity to the visitor centre.","zh":"屋顶上的太阳能板为游客中心供电。","note":"solar · 太阳的； 太阳能的 · solar panels","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s365","en":"Sunlight entered the reading room through a large glass dome.","zh":"阳光透过巨大的玻璃穹顶照进阅览室。","note":"dome · 圆屋顶； 穹顶 · a glass dome","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s366","en":"The film's cinematography captures the changing light across the desert.","zh":"影片的摄影捕捉了沙漠中光线的变化。","note":"cinematography · 电影摄影术 · beautiful cinematography","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s367","en":"An electrician replaced the damaged fuse before testing the lights.","zh":"电工更换受损保险丝后测试了灯具。","note":"fuse · 因保险丝烧断而断电； 熔合； 熔化；保险丝 · a blown fuse","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s368","en":"The shop sells premium coffee from several small mountain farms.","zh":"这家店销售几座山间小农场出产的优质咖啡。","note":"premium · 高级的，优质的； · premium coffee","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s369","en":"The guide tried to assure us that another bus was coming.","zh":"导游试图向我们保证另一辆公交车正在赶来。","note":"assure · 使确信， 使确保； 保证， 向…保证 · assure someone that","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s370","en":"Consult the user guide before changing the printer settings.","zh":"修改打印机设置前，请查阅用户指南。","note":"consult · 请教； 查阅； 商议 · consult a guide","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s371","en":"Neighbours gathered to show solidarity with families affected by the flood.","zh":"邻居们聚集起来，表达对受洪水影响家庭的支持。","note":"solidarity · 团结， 一致 · show solidarity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s372","en":"This is merely a suggestion, so please consider other options.","zh":"这只是一个建议，请也考虑其他选项。","note":"merely · 仅仅， 只不过 · merely a suggestion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s373","en":"The essay explores an apparent contradiction between the author's two claims.","zh":"文章探讨了作者两个主张之间的明显矛盾。","note":"contradiction · 矛盾， 不一致； 否认， 反驳 · an apparent contradiction","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s374","en":"These plants can survive the winter if sheltered from strong winds.","zh":"这些植物如果避开强风，就能度过冬季。","note":"survive · 活下来； 幸免于； 比…活得长， 比…长命 · survive the winter","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s375","en":"Our initial assessment suggested that the roof needed minor repairs.","zh":"我们的初步评估表明，屋顶需要少量维修。","note":"initial · 最初的，开始的；词首的；词首大写字母 · an initial assessment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s376","en":"I had only a rudimentary knowledge of Spanish before moving.","zh":"搬家前，我只掌握了一点基础西班牙语。","note":"rudimentary · 基本的， 初步的； 未充分发展的， 发育不成熟的； 退化的 · rudimentary knowledge","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s377","en":"The vase balanced in a precarious position on the narrow shelf.","zh":"花瓶在狭窄架子上摆得摇摇欲坠。","note":"precarious · 不安全的， 充满危险的； 不牢靠的， 不稳固的 · a precarious position","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s378","en":"The chapter introduces a conceptual framework for studying urban growth.","zh":"这一章介绍了研究城市增长的概念框架。","note":"conceptual · 观念的， 概念的 · a conceptual framework","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s379","en":"The old legend tells of a fountain promising eternal youth.","zh":"这个古老传说讲述了一座据说能让人永葆青春的泉。","note":"eternal · 永恒的 · eternal youth","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s380","en":"The distant lighthouse was barely visible through the thick fog.","zh":"浓雾中，远处的灯塔几乎看不见。","note":"barely · 仅仅， 几乎不； 赤裸裸地， 无遮蔽地 · barely visible","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s381","en":"The survey challenged a prevalent belief about teenagers' reading habits.","zh":"调查质疑了人们对青少年阅读习惯的一种普遍看法。","note":"prevalent · 流行的， 普遍的 · a prevalent belief","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s382","en":"The teacher played a short clip from the documentary.","zh":"老师播放了纪录片中的一小段。","note":"clip · 夹住， 扣住； 剪， 修剪；夹子， 回形针， 别针； 弹夹； 修剪； 剪报， 电影片断 · a short clip","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s383","en":"The team suffered a crushing defeat in the final match.","zh":"这支球队在决赛中遭遇了惨败。","note":"crushing · 惨重的， 毁灭性的； 压倒的， 决定性的 · a crushing defeat","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s384","en":"The researchers compared nutrient levels in soil from three farms.","zh":"研究人员比较了三个农场土壤中的养分含量。","note":"nutrient · 滋养物， 营养品 · nutrient levels","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s385","en":"Her practical advice proved invaluable during my first teaching placement.","zh":"她的实用建议在我第一次教学实习期间极为宝贵。","note":"invaluable · 无价的 · invaluable advice","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s386","en":"The compact design makes this desk suitable for small rooms.","zh":"紧凑的设计让这张书桌适合小房间。","note":"compact · 紧密的，结实的；简明的；紧凑的；使紧凑， 压缩 · a compact design","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s387","en":"Campaigners asked the council to outlaw dumping beside the river.","zh":"倡议者要求市政委员会禁止在河边倾倒垃圾。","note":"outlaw · 亡命之徒，逃犯，被剥夺法律权益者；宣布…为非法， 使…成为非法 · outlaw a practice","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s388","en":"The broken irrigation system could spell doom for the young seedlings.","zh":"灌溉系统损坏可能给幼苗带来灭顶之灾。","note":"doom · 注定…失败，使…在劫难逃；毁灭； 厄运， 劫数 · spell doom","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s389","en":"Her grandfather's watch remains her most treasured possession.","zh":"祖父的手表仍是她最珍视的物品。","note":"possession · 持有， 拥有； 所有权； 所有物， 财产， 财富； 领土 · a prized possession","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s390","en":"Different colours denote the three categories shown on the map.","zh":"不同颜色表示地图上展示的三个类别。","note":"denote · 表示， 指示； 意味着 · denote a category","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s391","en":"The cherry trees were in full bloom beside the station.","zh":"车站旁的樱花树正盛开着花朵。","note":"bloom · 开花；花；开花；青春焕发 · in full bloom","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s392","en":"The council turned the old market street into a pedestrian zone.","zh":"市政委员会把老市场街改成了步行区。","note":"zone · 地区， 地带； 区域 · a pedestrian zone","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s393","en":"The film's complex storyline becomes clearer during the final scenes.","zh":"影片复杂的情节在最后几个场景中变得清楚。","note":"storyline · 故事情节 · a complex storyline","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s394","en":"The gardener showed us how to propagate roses from cuttings.","zh":"园丁向我们展示了如何通过扦插繁殖玫瑰。","note":"propagate · 繁殖， 增殖； 传播， 宣传， 使普及 · propagate plants","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s395","en":"Her experimental methods challenged the orthodox approach to teaching sculpture.","zh":"她的实验性方法挑战了传统的雕塑教学方式。","note":"orthodox · 正统的， 传统的 · an orthodox approach","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s396","en":"The region began to industrialise rapidly after the railway arrived.","zh":"铁路通达后，这个地区开始迅速工业化。","note":"industrialise · 工业化 · industrialise rapidly","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-25:s397","en":"Public trust is the keystone of the museum's donation programme.